						<documentation value="Class of Airspace per ICAO Annex 11. Appendix 4.  IFR and VFR flights are permitted; all flights are provided with air traffic control service and IFR flights are separated from other IFR flights and from VFR flights.  VFR flights are separated from IFR flights and receive traffic information."/>
