						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Class of Airspace per ICAO Annex 11. Appendix 4.  IFR and VFR flights are permitted; IFR flights are provided with air traffic control service and are separated from other IFR flights.  All flights receive traffic information as far as is practical.  Class E shall not be used for control zones. "/>
