						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Any of the class of substances that are characteristically lustrous, ductile, fusible, malleable solids and are good conductors of heat and electricity.  For example, gold, silver, copper, iron, lead, tin, and certain alloys (as brass and bronze)."/>
