						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Constructed principally from mud applied to a structural scaffold of plant material (for example: wooden posts).  Effective only in extremely dry climates and usually must be resurfaced on a regular basis (for example: yearly) otherwise the structure steadily disintegrates under the effect of weather."/>
						<model ea_localid="2949" ea_guid="{750D3F25-E9AE-4a7b-8CB2-2E7FDCDB3856}"/>
