						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Any of numerous artificially produced alloys of iron containing up to 3 per cent of other elements (including less than about 2.2 per cent carbon) and having great strength and malleability.  Able to be tempered to many different degrees of hardness.  Used for making tools, weapons, and/or machinery."/>
						<model ea_localid="2954" ea_guid="{FDE923D0-DD72-4e3e-A5E6-DE97EE41FB3A}"/>
