				<properties documentation="The value of a bearing indication (at a given point) measured as the angle between the bearing and either True North or Magnetic North (this should appear explicitly or implicitly). The angle is measured clockwise from 0 degrees up to and including 360 degrees. The value can also be a VOR radial. For example, Westward is expressed as 270. " isSpecification="false" sType="Class" nType="0" scope="public" stereotype="DataType" isRoot="false" isLeaf="false" isAbstract="false" isActive="false"/>
