						<initial/>
						<documentation value="&quot;Close-In Obstacles&quot; are those that would penetrate the 40:1 OCS and would require a climb gradient to 200 feet or less above the departure end of runway.   So if an aircraft climbs at the minimum standard 200 feet per NM, &quot;Close-In Obstacles&quot; are those within 1 NM from the end of the runway.  "/>
