				<properties documentation="This package contains definitions of application schemas and eventual third party extensions to the core AIXM, which are needed for a particular system/application that implements AIXM.&#xA;&#xA;Although not part of the core AIXM, these extensions are included in the published AIXM file in order to share them with the AIXM stakeholder community. Withe the time, if they evolve towards global acceptance, some of these extensions might become part of the core model.&#xA;&#xA;For the moment, it cannot be ensured that these extensions are not overlapping with each other or with elements from the core model. The owner of each Application Schema is responsible for its content." isSpecification="false" sType="Package" nType="0" scope="public"/>
